# UWMS AI RULES (Strict & Non-negotiable)

1. UI Library: STRICTLY use `@arco-design/web-react` and `@arco-design/web-react/icon`. Do NOT install or use TailwindCSS, MUI, Ant Design, Chakra UI, Lucide icons, etc.
2. Routing: STRICTLY use `react-router-dom`. No custom tab switchers.
3. Server State: STRICTLY use `@tanstack/react-query` for API fetching and caching. Zustand is strictly for local client UI state (theme, tokens).
4. No Mock / No Hardcoded Data: All data must be fetched dynamically from the NestJS PostgreSQL backend. No hardcoded names, prices, or serials.
5. Atomic Transactions: All state modifications (stock reduction, request fulfillment, asset transfers) must run inside Prisma `$transaction`.
6. Security: All sensitive mutating endpoints must use `JwtAuthGuard` and `RolesGuard`.
7. University Domain Rules: Include funding sources (BYUDJET, KONTRAKT_RIVOJLANTIRISH, GRANT), monthly department limits, and official acts (OS-1, OS-2, OS-4, INV-19).
